            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice impostando correttamente <code>headers</code>, <code>params</code> e <code>data</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"headers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;api-key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_SECRET_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"params = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;coding&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Learn Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://mimo.org/api/update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", headers=headers, params=params, json=data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"180\" /><option startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"195\" /><option startIndex=\"202\" endIndex=\"206\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>headers</code>, seguito da <code>params</code> e poi <code>data</code>, <code>headers</code>, <code>params</code>, <code>data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>api-key</code> per la chiave, <code>category</code> per <code>coding</code> e <code>title</code> per <code>Learn Python</code>.</p><p>Allega prima gli header, poi i parametri di query e infine il corpo JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"auth\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;api-key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_SECRET_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;coding&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"payload\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Learn Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"put\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://mimo.org/api/update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"headers\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"auth\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"params\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"filters\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"json\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"payload\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"180\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"196\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json=auth\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"headers=filters\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params=payload\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"api-key\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"category\"</code>, <code>\"title\"</code>, <code>headers=auth</code>, <code>params=filters</code> e infine <code>json=payload</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
